        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "In this example (Figure 149), one will end up with 10 distinct areas. While those areas are always the same each, PriceAlgorithm will apply a different rule which determines the price (EnergyFee) that each of the 10 energy content areas need to be multiplied with in order to compute and predict a resulting energy fee sum.",
